Mutation f3: restores the behaviour before 5480dae ("Accept verified queue teams on their verified base and worktree"),
whose parent, the pre-fix commit, is 9c99ddc.
Queue acceptance required the plan to name the entry's .git directory and bound the queue-time base, so a team verified on the moved base, or whose plan named the builder worktree, was refused.
Evidence only: TestDeliveryLifecycle must fail with this applied (see ../fails-before.md).
Apply from the repository root with git apply; never commit it applied.

